Bug Bounty Skill Creator

This skill is based on the skill-creator skill that ships with OpenAI Codex,
which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see license.txt).

Changes made for this repo:

- Renamed from skill-creator to bug-bounty-skill-creator so it doesn't clash
  with the skill-creator that's built into Codex.
- Rewrote SKILL.md in plain English and added guidance for this repo's bug
  bounty skills.
- Added a default_prompt to agents/openai.yaml.
- scripts/quick_validate.py, scripts/generate_openai_yaml.py and
  scripts/init_skill.py now read and write files as UTF-8, so they work on
  Windows too.
